WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.750
A new schedule is posted, and Alex notices a problem.

2
00:00:04.261 --> 00:00:06.084
One of the upcoming shifts now conflicts

3
00:00:06.084 --> 00:00:08.557
with an important responsibility outside of work.

4
00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:10.727
The shift is not starting right now, so

5
00:00:10.727 --> 00:00:13.177
there is still time to respond well.

6
00:00:13.177 --> 00:00:16.103
This moment is not really about the conflict itself.

7
00:00:16.103 --> 00:00:18.935
It is about communication, planning, and

8
00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:20.897
how quickly Alex takes action.
